<title>USA: Va. Resources Authority yields 5.85 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>Va. Resources Authority yields 5.85 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer said it tentatively priced $3.100 million of Virginia Resources Authority, water and sewer revenue bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.85 percent in 2027.</p>
